   85.0   102.5   120.0   113.0   127.0   134.0
> summary(df$`blood pressure`)
   Min. 1st Qu.  Median    Mean 3rd Qu.    Max.
   85.0   102.5   120.0   113.0   127.0   134.0
>
> # But only backticks work with select
> library("dplyr")
> dplyr::select(df, "blood pressure")
